src/hmz is the humanize runtime (https://github.com/humanfia/humanize),
Copyright 2026 Zijian Zhang, vendored at the version HMA was measured against.
This package uses HMA module and container names, defaults to a
five-experiment cap, removes operational comments and remote catalog links,
and disables telemetry. External model CLIs, the upstream MLE-bench grader,
and task data retain their own licenses and are not included. The Apache
License 2.0 text is in LICENSE; the MIT License text for src/hma/benchmark is
in src/hma/benchmark/LICENSE.
